# ---------- CDN upload folder (served from graphixs.cdn.yilmazdoga.net) ----------
# Sync this folder's contents to the CDN root, e.g. `aws s3 sync cdn/ s3://<bucket>/`
# so cdn/videos/... maps to graphixs.cdn.yilmazdoga.net/videos/...
cdn/

# ---------- Large media ----------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.avi

